# What this repo publishes
# ────────────────────────
# One directory per case study. Inside each:
#
#   README.md        the case study, summarised
#   index.html       the report, served as a GitHub Page
#   analysis.ipynb   the executed notebook (ships WITH outputs — GitHub renders
#                    notebooks statically and never executes them, so stripped
#                    outputs would show a visitor nothing)
#   charts/          the static charts the README embeds, plus their specs
#   data/            the portable inputs a reader needs; raw source tables are
#                    linked, not redistributed
#   assets/fonts/    DM Sans TTFs
#
# Everything below stays local. Patterns here are deliberately unanchored
# (no leading slash) so they match at any depth — a rule written for one
# study has to keep working when the next four land beside it.

# ── Working documents, not deliverables ───────────────────────────────
PRD.md
findings.md
story.md
report.md
post.md
memory.md
brief.md
*-brief.md
briefs/
PIPELINE.md
RUN.md
EXIT.md
LEARNINGS.md
contract.md
project-profile.md

# ── Agent / workspace tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.mcp.json
settings.local.json

# ── Pipeline internals ────────────────────────────────────────────────
scripts/
out/
tools/
Analysis/
Blogging/
_archive-old-run/

# ── Raw source tables, deliberately not redistributed ─────────────────
# Large, and nothing in this repo reads them: every report and notebook
# ships with its outputs baked in. Each study's README names the source
# and where to fetch it if you want to rebuild from scratch.
USvideos.csv
*.csv.gz
*.zip

# ── Derived binaries ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Regenerable caches, and pickles execute arbitrary code on load — not
# something to hand a stranger who clones this. Ship the portable inputs.
*.pkl
*.feather
*.parquet

# ── Scratch render checks ─────────────────────────────────────────────
*-render-check.png
*.log

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
venv/
.venv/

# ── Jupyter ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── OS / editor noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.Rhistory
Thumbs.db
